+ *  - Producers: the vaddfp/vsubfp/vmaddfp/vnmsubfp op.  Its short path
+ *    writes a zero or normal in every lane (result test: FLT_MIN < |r| <
+ *    inf; exempt lanes: +-0 from two zero operands, or b from a zero
+ *    product, b being zero or normal) and does not touch vec_status: vD
