+ *    and vor vD,vA,vA move whole lanes: vD is known when its sources are
+ *    (producers: theirs, VFPK_NPROD at most); vxor vD,vA,vA and vspltis[bhw]
+ *    0 write zeros (no producer).
+ *  - Any other instruction goes through vfpk_scan(): a TCG store into an
