+ *    (but the helpers of vfpk_safe_call(): vD only), as do a label, a branch,
+ *    a store through another base than env.  ppc_fp32 ops (FPRs, FPSCR,
+ *    fp_status) drop nothing; the other kinds of ppc_vfp (vcmp*fp, vcf*,
